{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Registry of numeric claim strings in the resume-facing docs. Each claim is formatted from one committed artifact field (field grammar: dot keys, [index], [key=value] selectors; ratio denominators may be len:<path>). Each ref names a doc and an anchor: every line of that doc containing the anchor must contain the claim string, and at least one such line must exist. A changed digit in a doc, or a changed artifact value, fails tests/firmware/host/test_claim_drift.py.",
